                end: 114,
                help: Some(
                    "**Why:** Interactive roles imply the element can be activated by keyboard users.\n\n**Fix:**\n```vue\n<div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" @click=\"handle\">\n  Click me\n</div>\n```\n\n**Better:** Use native interactive elements:\n```vue\n<button @click=\"handle\">Click me</button>\n```",
